# Only combat damage, and only while its creature is still unblocked as it would deal it (CR 609.7b; the ruling: a blocked
# creature's trample damage is not Forcefield's). Combat Celebrant's exert untaps the other attackers. Orcish Artillery, chosen
# once blockers are declared, deals 2 noncombat damage to Forcefield's controller - dealt in full - and then 1 combat damage,
# of which the shield prevents none. Goliath Beetle, unblocked in the first combat, is chosen in its end of combat step; it
# attacks again in the additional combat phase (CR 500.8), is blocked by Crimson Kobolds and tramples 2 over them to
# Forcefield's controller - dealt in full, though that shield still waits.
